div class=\"tnum mt-0.5 text-[12px] text-[var(--slate)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-7-4-2\" data-name=\"tickets sold count\">1,204 of 2,000 sold</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-4 shrink-0 text-right text-[15px] text-[var(--slate)] transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:text-[var(--flame)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-7-5\" data-name=\"event card arrow icon\">→</div>\n</a>\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex items-baseline justify-between border-b border-[var(--line)] pb-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-8\" data-name=\"Sun 9 November day group header\">\n<h2 class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-8-1\" data-name=\"day date heading\">Sun 9 November <span class=\"ml-2 font-normal normal-case tracking-normal text-[var(--slate)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-8-1-1\" data-name=\"day event count\">1 event</span></h2>\n</div>\n<a class=\"group flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-[var(--line)] py-4 hover:bg-[var(--shell)]/60 sm:gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9\" data-name=\"The River and the Rage event card\">\n<div class=\"w-9 shrink-0 text-[13px] tnum text-[var(--slate)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9-1\" data-name=\"event start time\">17:00</div>\n<div class=\"h-[64px] w-[96px] shrink-0 overflow-hidden bg-[var(--shell)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9-2\" data-name=\"event thumbnail container\">\n<img alt=\"Performer singing into a microphone, photo by Klang Lumpikanon on Pexels\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9-2-1\" data-name=\"event thumbnail image (singer at microphone)\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/4823687/pexels-photo-4823687.jpeg?auto=compress&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;w=320\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9-3\" data-name=\"event info group\">\n<div class=\"display text-[21px] leading-tight\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9-3-1\" data-name=\"event title\">The River and the Rage</div>\n<div class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[var(--slate)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-3-2-9-3-2\" data-name=\"event